# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# PsN SCM benchmark (script/psn_scm): commit the LIGHT keepers, ignore the
# HEAVY run trees.  output/ and *.rds/*.csv are ignored above, so we must
# re-include each parent level, then the two keeper subtrees.
#   runs/       -> heavy PsN/NONMEM churn (disposable, HPCE scratch): IGNORED
#   records/    -> per-cell psn_scm_record.{rds,meta.json}          : COMMITTED
#   aggregated/ -> cohort roll-ups (rds/csv)                        : COMMITTED
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
!output/
output/*
!output/psn_scm/
output/psn_scm/*
!output/psn_scm/records/
!output/psn_scm/records/**
!output/psn_scm/aggregated/
!output/psn_scm/aggregated/**
# keep runs/ explicitly ignored even though it lives under the re-included parent
output/psn_scm/runs/
output/psn_scm/records/